# This repository is PUBLIC. Nothing here should reveal local infrastructure,
# hostnames, key paths, or credentials.

# Design docs and plans — they reference internal build hosts and key paths.
docs/

# Spike results — measurements and environment findings from specific hosts.
# Kept local for the same reason as docs/: sanitizing them by hand before every
# commit is a step that only has to be forgotten once.
spike/RESULTS.md

# Office probe output — raw prompts, raw model responses, and the endpoint's
# own identifying detail. Captured on every run by design.
spike/office/out/

# Local agent/tool configuration.
.claude/
.opencode/
AGENTS.local.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# Credentials and secrets.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
auth.json
*.pem
*.key
*.gpg
*.asc
id_*
!id_*.md
secrets.*

# Local build scratch.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.tar.gz
.versions
*.log

# OS noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
